                </div>
                <a href="https://github.com/mbrajk/document-indexer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="view-link">View on GitHub &rarr;</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card card-bg">
                <h3>YNAB To Google Sheets Sync Tool</h3>
                <p class="description">Syncs a YNAB budget to Google Sheets. Requires a Google service account and a YNAB developer API key.</p>
                <div class="tags">
                    <span class="tag">.NET</span>
                    <span class="tag">C#</span>
                    <span class="tag">Google Sheets API</span>
                    <span class="tag">YNAB API</span>
                </div>
                <a href="https://github.com/mbrajk/ynab-gsheet-syncer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="view-link">View on GitHub &rarr;</a>
